{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109120135519-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109120223\"/><p>美國傳媒周日（8日）播出總統特朗普的專訪，他指出人工智能（AI）帶來的風險是可以控制的，他對安全保障措施持開放態度，不介意設置護欄。</p><p>被問及美國是否應該為了領先中國而接受AI風險時，特朗普稱AI的危險是可控的，願意與民主黨人合作制訂保障措施。</p><p>特朗普也強調，不希望監管AI使美國遠遠落後於中國，因為中國沒有這樣的限制。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.534231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:17.235342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.955059+00:00","content_hash":"2a0d6d832153a37ac07e8a24ea7d8108e4a9773da7a556eb6d13dd5de4084718","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}